  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Shark Demon introduces the smiling fat Gu Immortal as Big Bag Lu Tan Xin, who mainly cultivates space path but also has wisdom path attainment. Lu Tan Xin greets Fang Yuan with goodwill and names Eastern Sea’s three best wisdom path experts: Song Jia Dan, Hua An, and Dragon Head Tortoise.",
      "chapters": [
        903
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shark_demon",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_song_jia_dan",
        "char_hua_an",
        "char_dragon_head_tortoise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He wears a golden robe and has a fat body, looking like a rich person as he smiles.",
      "chapters": [
        903
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When he investigates, his eyes turn into vertical pupils like a cat’s eyes.",
      "chapters": [
        904
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan looks at Big Bag Lu Tan Xin and guesses the title may point to skilled storage methods for a space path Gu Immortal. Lu Tan Xin observes for a few breaths, then strikes and destroys eight hidden Gu worms with each strike. Fang Yuan judges him slower than Ninth Ghost Finger, and that Shark Demon’s ranking of the three helpers matches: Lu Tan Xin has wisdom path attainment, Ninth Ghost Finger cultivates wisdom path on the side, and Xie Shu Fang as a main wisdom path cultivator is the strongest of the three.",
      "chapters": [
        904
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yu-lu-investigation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "char_ninth_ghost_finger",
        "char_xie_shu_fang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Even with the advantage of his wisdom path inheritance, Fang Yuan judges he can surpass Bo Dan, Lu Tan Xin, and Ninth Ghost Finger, yet still lacks much against Xie Shu Fang.",
      "chapters": [
        905
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-path-gap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bo_dan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Big Bag Lu Tan Xin and Ninth Ghost Finger still cannot match Fang Yuan in wisdom path methods, which Shark Demon learns while unraveling the battlefield killer move, and Xie Shu Fang stands far above Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        906
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-path-gap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
